    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994050/extras/f1d9d4f7da0d85c0a4a8de9a80065e03.avif?t=1740044113\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Story </h2><br>I, Li Zhiyuan, was an ordinary university student.<br>Although I was just living an ordinary life, I was quite content with a stable daily routine.<br>... But\u2026if that was true, what about the strange feelings that came up from time to time?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994050/extras/48165e268e0427f790c3e859b5852258.avif?t=1740044113\" /></div><br><br>The mysterious man who suddenly appeared claimed to be an icubus and seemed to have a strange obsession with me.<br>Could I really believe what he said? And why was he so insistent?<br>What was even stranger was that this strange man had always seemed familiar to me for no apparent reason\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994050/extras/fed8d385794dac662b4558b89da033f9.avif?t=1740044113\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Game Features</h2><br>\u25c7An R-18 BL adventure visual novel featuring an incubus and a university student. <br>\u25c7The main character will go to a different future with the choices you make<br>\u25c7Travel through the world of dreams, find your memories and face your heart<br>\u25c7A 50,000-word story with 6 CGs and 2 main endings to explore<br>\u25c7Full CG mode can be turned on for free browsing of HCGs<br>\u25c7Stress-free operation, enjoy the bitter-sweet love story with ease",
